Package: LDdecay
Title: Advanced Tools for Linkage Disequilibrium Decay and Functional Mapping
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-08-11
Authors@R: c(
    person(
        "Mohammad Jan", "Shamim",
        email = "mshamim11@uky.edu",
        role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person(
        "Samuel", "Revolinski",
        email = "sr.revolinski@uky.edu",
        role = "aut"))
Description: A collection of optimized tools for calculation, grouping,
    and advanced visualization of global genome-wide linkage disequilibrium
    (LD) decay profiles, regional block tracking, and fast overlapping
    variant-to-gene mapping from standardized GFF3 annotations.
